{
  "description": "The reading notation (DocSpecs specification, Reading Notation RN-1 to RN-13). `cases`: one text value each, scanned with scanNotation(text, tomSpecs); `elements` are the top-level elements with their nested `children`, `start`/`end` UTF-16 offsets, 1-based `line`/`endLine`, and `source`/`content` the text slices; `findings` in source order. `validatorCases`: a document of docspecs_schema.yaml validated with DocSpecsValidator(schema, tomSpecs), the expected violations as rule, sectionId and line, the notation findings after the other rules. Hand-maintained; Dart and TypeScript run it (05a_rdv4 audits the other seven runtimes).",
